        <bpmn2:documentation id="Documentation_1794898681951" textFormat="text/plain">Scenario lab 3.0: 3 practical cases. Configure ScenarioId, Save, Deploy. Inspect native steps, runtime settings, header/property/body tabs and assertion reports. Negative cases intentionally fail. See the complete canvas lab handbook.</bpmn2:documentation>
